OL,3,GNEWSA'Every poppy in handcrafted
OL,4,Adisplay means a life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 20,000 handcrafted poppies
OL,7,Fhave been put on display at a church
OL,8,Ffollowing a huge community effort.
OL,10,FOver 120 volunteers and groups have
OL,11,Fhelp to knit, sew and crochet the array
OL,12,Fof red, purple, blue and white flowers.
OL,14,FThe installation was unveiled at Holy
OL,15,FTrinity Church in Skipton, North
OL,16,FYorkshire, on Friday, and is the
OL,17,Fculmination of a project which began in
OL,18,FMarch 2025.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
