OL,3,GNEWSA'Every poppy in handcrafted
OL,4,Adisplay means a life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCo-ordinator Helen Smith said she was
OL,7,F"emotional" and "humbled" the number of
OL,8,Fpeople who have given their time and
OL,9,Fskills to the display.
